IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pp-rules`

-- Parliamentary Privileges Act 1987 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of person`, imp IS A BOOLEAN, defam IS A BOOLEAN, pres IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Privileges case`
`a case for` k `interfering` imp `only critical` defam `in the presence` pres MEANS
    `Privileges case` OF k, imp, defam, pres, `none of these`, FALSE, `none of these`, Date 1 1 2026, LIST Date 1 1 2026

`person` MEANS `a natural person`

-- ss 4, 6, 7
#ASSERT `a House may punish` (`a case for` `person` `interfering` TRUE `only critical` FALSE `in the presence` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`a House may punish` (`a case for` `person` `interfering` FALSE `only critical` FALSE `in the presence` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`a House may punish` (`a case for` `person` `interfering` TRUE `only critical` TRUE `in the presence` FALSE))
#ASSERT `a House may punish` (`a case for` `person` `interfering` TRUE `only critical` TRUE `in the presence` TRUE)
#ASSERT `the House's maximum months for` (`a case for` `person` `interfering` TRUE `only critical` FALSE `in the presence` FALSE) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the House's maximum fine for` (`a case for` `person` `interfering` TRUE `only critical` FALSE `in the presence` FALSE) EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the House's maximum fine for` (`a case for` `a corporation` `interfering` TRUE `only critical` FALSE `in the presence` FALSE) EQUALS 25000

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of person`, w IS A `Statutory conduct`, auth IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Privileges case`
`a case where` k `does` w `authorised` auth MEANS
    `Privileges case` OF k, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, w, auth, `none of these`, Date 1 1 2026, LIST Date 1 1 2026

-- ss 12-13
#ASSERT `I commit a statutory offence` (`a case where` `person` `does` `improperly influencing a witness's evidence, or inducing them not to give it` `authorised` FALSE)
#ASSERT `I commit a statutory offence` (`a case where` `person` `does` `penalising or injuring a person on account of evidence` `authorised` TRUE)
#ASSERT `I commit a statutory offence` (`a case where` `person` `does` `publishing or disclosing in camera evidence without authority` `authorised` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit a statutory offence` (`a case where` `person` `does` `publishing or disclosing in camera evidence without authority` `authorised` TRUE))
#ASSERT `the statutory maximum units for` (`a case where` `person` `does` `penalising or injuring a person on account of evidence` `authorised` FALSE) EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `the statutory maximum months for` (`a case where` `person` `does` `penalising or injuring a person on account of evidence` `authorised` FALSE) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the statutory maximum units for` (`a case where` `a corporation` `does` `penalising or injuring a person on account of evidence` `authorised` FALSE) EQUALS 250
#ASSERT `the statutory maximum months for` (`a case where` `a corporation` `does` `penalising or injuring a person on account of evidence` `authorised` FALSE) EQUALS 0

GIVEN r IS A `My role`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Privileges case`
`a` r `asked on` d MEANS
    `Privileges case` OF `a natural person`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, r, d, LIST Date 10 3 2026, Date 11 3 2026

-- s 14(1): a member, within 5 days before or after a sitting day.
#ASSERT `I am immune that day` (`a` `a member of a House` `asked on` (Date 5 3 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am immune that day` (`a` `a member of a House` `asked on` (Date 4 3 2026)))
#ASSERT `I am immune that day` (`a` `a member of a House` `asked on` (Date 16 3 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am immune that day` (`a` `a member of a House` `asked on` (Date 17 3 2026)))
#ASSERT `I am immune that day` (`a` `an officer of a House` `asked on` (Date 12 3 2026))
-- s 14(3): a witness, only on the day required.
#ASSERT `I am immune that day` (`a` `a person required to attend before a House or committee` `asked on` (Date 10 3 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am immune that day` (`a` `a person required to attend before a House or committee` `asked on` (Date 12 3 2026)))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am immune that day` (`a` `none of these` `asked on` (Date 10 3 2026)))
